        "title": "三角形：选公式与判多解",
        "summary": "边与其对角对应，先判断资料类型。",
        "method": [
          {
            "title": "方法",
            "body": "直角三角形用 $a^2+b^2=c^2$ 和六个三角比。一般三角形：$A+B+C=180^\\circ$，$a/\\sin A=b/\\sin B=c/\\sin C$，$c^2=a^2+b^2-2ab\\cos C$。SSA 用反正弦后还须检查补角是否使角和小于 $180^\\circ$。面积 $K=ab\\sin C/2=\\sqrt{s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)}$，$s=(a+b+c)/2$。"
          }
        ],
        "pitfalls": [
          "外角不是三角形内角；边长须正，三边须满足严格三角不等式。"
        ],
        "en": {
          "title": "Triangles: formulas and ambiguity",
          "summary": "Match sides with opposite angles and classify the given data.",
          "method": [
            {
              "title": "Method",
              "body": "For a right triangle use $a^2+b^2=c^2$ and the six ratios. In any triangle, $A+B+C=180^\\circ$, $a/\\sin A=b/\\sin B=c/\\sin C$, and $c^2=a^2+b^2-2ab\\cos C$. For SSA, also test the supplementary inverse-sine angle against the angle sum. Area: $K=ab\\sin C/2=\\sqrt{s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)}$, $s=(a+b+c)/2$."
            }
          ],
          "pitfalls": [
            "An exterior angle is not an interior angle. Side lengths must be positive and satisfy strict triangle inequalities."
          ]
        }
